 polarization, minimize the arithmetic mean power reflectance sampled from 450 to 700 nm at 5 nm spacing. A mean reflectance below 0.03 is the stated target. Use deterministic TMM only, with no RCWA, FDFD, learned surrogate or hardware. Allow at most two executed research rounds with one route and at most 64 solver evaluations per round, seed 17. After observing the actual result, choose a justified adjustment or stop. Do not claim the target was met without the spectrum and independent numeric check.\nPreserve its physical constraints. Performance targets remain soft objectives.", "input_sha256": "474a0601b2c6abeb989461f440d98a2e56b2f8bd274b249d92f3a45dcfd3806c", "force_mock": null}
